
uplink-syndicate-40-pistol-magazine-name = Pistol Magazine (.40 pistol)
uplink-syndicate-40-pistol-magazine-desc = A loaded .40 pistol magazine. Compatible with the Viper machine pistol.

uplink-syndicate-40-rifle-magazine-name = SMG Magazine (.40 pistol)
uplink-syndicate-40-rifle-magazine-desc = A loaded .40 SMG magazine, Compatible with the C-20r submachine gun.

uplink-advanced-medkit-name = Advanced Medkit
uplink-advanced-medkit-desc = An Advanced Medkit for less medically qualified rangers

uplink-pulsepistol-name = Pulse Pistol
uplink-pulsepistol-desc = An older model of a pulse pistol, often used by the TSF Navy's special operations troops this weapon is not as potent as the standard issue ones, but it still hurts.

uplink-pulsecarbine-name = Pulse Carbine
uplink-pulsecarbine-desc = An older model of Pulse weapon, often used by the TSF Navy's special operations troops this weapon is not as potent as the standard issue ones, but it still hurts.

uplink-pulseheavy-name = Heavy Pulse Rifle
uplink-pulseheavy-desc = Like the other LSRD Pulse Weapons, this Rifle is an older model, however it has been heavily modified by the LSRD to increase it's potency.

uplink-lsrdraid-name = Raid Suit Bundle
uplink-lsrdraid-desc = A co-opted Cybersun Raid Suit, this Raid Suit was purchased initially for the TSF-N until newer better variants hit the scene. Thus this version was added to Surplus stocks and provided to the LSRD at a discount over buying newer armor sets.

uplink-hypospraylsrd-name = NTCS-102 Hypospray
uplink-hypospraylsrd-desc = A sterile injector for rapid administration of drugs to patients.

uplink-forensicpadbox-name = Forensic Pads Box
uplink-forensicpadbox-desc = A forensic pad for collecting fingerprints or fibers.

uplink-evidencemarkerbox-name = Evidence Marker Box
uplink-evidencemarkerbox-desc = A pack of numbered yellow markers, useful for labeling evidence on a crime scene.

uplink-stingerlsrd-name = Stinger Grenade Box
uplink-stingerlsrd-desc = A box full of stinger grenades. Disperse!

uplink-forensicsmodule-name = Contraband Forensics Module
uplink-forensicsmodule-desc = A program for scanning and reporting contraband dead drops and pods for bounties.

uplink-dimeslippers-name = Slippers
uplink-dimeslippers-desc = Fluffy!

uplink-mk22-name = Mk22 "Colt"
uplink-mk22-desc = A Noble and Trusty Handgun seen in service with the Solarian Marines for over two hundred years. This weapon was adopted by the LSRD recently after a surplus of Mk22s were provided to Civilian Enforcement Agencies.

uplink-chemicalcratep-name = Chemical Crate - P Group
uplink-chemicalcratep-desc = A chemical crate containing the P group of chemicals

uplink-chemicalcrates-name = Chemical Crate - S Group
uplink-chemicalcrates-desc = A chemical crate containing the S group of chemicals

uplink-chemicalcrated-name = Chemical Crate - D Group
uplink-chemicalcrated-desc = A chemical crate containing the D group of chemicals
